title: F_Enter
---
<<if flagged("finale_won")>>
    Dex: The studio after the show. Confetti everywhere. Some of it is in my shoes. I'm keeping it.
<<elseif not flagged("f_intro")>>
    Dex: The Speed Daters Live studio. Real cameras. Real lights. Real chance of throwing up on live TV.
    Dex: And the audience... wait. That's everybody. Everybody I met tonight came to watch!
    Chet Studwell: Well, well. You must be the other guy. Chet Studwell. Perfect teeth, perfect hair, perfect record.
    Chet Studwell: Put 'er there, pal!
    Dex: He shakes my hand with the hand that's holding a giant grape soda. Splash. All down my shirt.
    Chet Studwell: Whoopsie! Purple's a great colour on you. For a loser.
    Dex: A purple blob, right in the middle of my hibiscus. On live TV. Great.
    Dex: Roxy's waving me over to her podium. Probably to talk about the blob.
    <<flag f_intro>>
    <<flag f_shirt_stained>>
<<endif>>
===

title: F_Exit_Look
---
Dex: The stage door, back out to the campus. The red EXIT sign is judging me.
===
title: F_Exit_Use
---
<<if flagged("finale_won") or not flagged("f_intro")>>
    <<go campus from_map>>
<<else>>
    Dex: Run away now? With everybody watching? Uncle Vic didn't raise a quitter. He mostly sent letters, but still.
    -> Leave anyway, just for a minute
        <<go campus from_map>>
    -> Stay
        Dex: Right. Showtime. Probably.
<<endif>>
===

title: F_GreenDoor_Look
---
Dex: A door with a paper star taped to it: GREEN ROOM. It's not green. Television lies to us all.
===
title: F_GreenDoor_Use
---
<<go tv_green_room from_studio>>
===

title: F_BoothWindow_Look
---
<<if flagged("finale_won")>>
    Dex: The control booth window. Norma's up there with her feet on the desk, eating a cheese puff. Victory looks good on everybody.
<<elseif flagged("f_tape_swapped")>>
    Dex: The control booth window. Norma's back at her desk. She has no idea Kevin is down here. Kevin is everywhere.
<<else>>
    Dex: A dark window high above the green room door: the control booth. Someone up there in a headset is glaring at a clock like it owes her money.
    <<flag f_saw_booth>>
<<endif>>
===
title: F_BoothWindow_Use
---
<<if flagged("f_booth_ok")>>
    Dex: I wave up at the booth. Norma waves back without looking. "Not now, Kevin," she mouths.
<<else>>
    Dex: I wave at the booth. The woman up there points at her headset, then at me, then draws a finger across her throat. I think that means "not now".
    Dex: There's no ladder. The way up must be through the green room.
    <<flag f_saw_booth>>
<<endif>>
===

title: F_Roxy_Look
---
<<if flagged("finale_won")>>
    Dex: Roxy Vale, finally off the clock, eating a cold slice of studio pizza. Still has perfect lighting.
<<else>>
    Dex: Roxy Vale at the hosting podium, flipping through cue cards. She looks like she was born under a spotlight.
<<endif>>
===
title: F_Roxy_Talk
---
<<if flagged("finale_won")>>
    <<jump F_Roxy_PostCredits>>
<<elseif not flagged("f_met_roxy")>>
    Roxy Vale: Lover boy! You made it to the grand finale! I knew it the second I saw that shirt.
    Roxy Vale: Here's the deal. We go live when you're ready. And right now you are not ready.
    Roxy Vale: One: you need a working mic. Two: that purple splotch can't be on my show. Three: bring your own track for the dance-off.
    Roxy Vale: And four... Chet tells me you've been sneaking in help. A hidden earpiece, he says.
    Dex: What? I don't even own an earpiece! I barely own pants!
    Roxy Vale: Then clear your name, lover boy. This is a clean show. Mostly.
    <<flag f_met_roxy>>
<<elseif flagged("f_miked") and flagged("f_shirt_clean") and flagged("f_track_ready") and flagged("f_chet_busted")>>
    Roxy Vale: Mic on, shirt clean, music loaded, name spotless. Lover boy, you are READY. Just say the word.
<<elseif flagged("f_chet_busted")>>
    Roxy Vale: My favourite honest contestant! Almost there, sweetie. The cameras are getting restless.
<<elseif flagged("f_tape_swapped")>>
    Roxy Vale: Have you seen Chet? He keeps slapping his ear like it owes him money. Did you do something, lover boy?
<<else>>
    Roxy Vale: Tick tock, lover boy. The network's breathing down my neck. It has bad breath.
<<endif>>
<<jump F_Roxy_Menu>>
===
title: F_Roxy_Menu
---
-> We're ready. Let's go live! <<if flagged("f_miked") and flagged("f_shirt_clean") and flagged("f_track_ready") and flagged("f_chet_busted")>>
    <<jump F_Show>>
-> What do I still need? <<if not (flagged("f_miked") and flagged("f_shirt_clean") and flagged("f_track_ready") and flagged("f_chet_busted"))>>
    Roxy Vale: Here's what's still missing:
    <<jump F_Hints>>
-> Tell me about this Trash-Talk Teaser. <<if flagged("f_duel_known") and not flagged("f_chet_busted")>>
    Roxy Vale: Before every finale, the two finalists trade insults for the cameras. Chet throws one, you throw one back. Fumble one and it's over.
    Roxy Vale: Chet has never lost. He has a comeback for everything. Even comebacks for his comebacks. Very fast. Suspiciously fast.
    Roxy Vale: Cut off whoever's whispering in his ear and he'll have nothing. Then find yourself some material. Half the women in that audience have survived a Chet.
    <<jump F_Roxy_Menu>>
-> Where would I find wardrobe around here? <<if not flagged("f_gr_intro")>>
    Roxy Vale: Green room, sweetie. Door under the booth window. Gloria does hair, makeup and wardrobe, and she does NOT do patience.
    <<jump F_Roxy_Menu>>
-> How did you get into hosting? <<if not flagged("f_roxy_lore1")>>
    Roxy Vale: I hosted a pie-eating contest at fourteen. Live, on the county fair stage. A man choked on a cherry, the tent caught fire, and I never stopped smiling.
    Roxy Vale: The producers said I had "unkillable energy". I put it on my business card.
    <<flag f_roxy_lore1>>
    <<jump F_Roxy_Menu>>
-> What do I get if I win? <<if not flagged("f_roxy_lore2")>>
    Roxy Vale: A dream date with anyone you choose, a heart-shaped trophy, and a lifetime of being recognised at the grocery store.
    Dex: That last one sounds terrifying.
    Roxy Vale: It is. Bring sunglasses.
    <<flag f_roxy_lore2>>
    <<jump F_Roxy_Menu>>
-> What's the deal with Chet? <<if not flagged("f_roxy_lore3") and not flagged("f_chet_busted")>>
    Roxy Vale: Chet's won every round this season. Every quiz, every dare, every date. His dad owns the network, but that's just a coincidence. A very well-funded coincidence.
    Roxy Vale: Between you and me, lover boy? I'd love to see him lose. Fair and square. Mostly square.
    <<flag f_roxy_lore3>>
    <<jump F_Roxy_Menu>>
-> I'll be back.
    Roxy Vale: Don't keep the cameras waiting, sweetie. They get moody.
===
title: F_Hints
---
<<if not flagged("f_chet_busted")>>
    <<if flagged("f_tape_swapped") and flagged("f_roxy_saw_walkie")>>
        Dex: Chet's earpiece is dead air now. Time to beat him at the Trash-Talk Teaser. I just have to call him out.
        <<if not flagged("f_cb_lacey")>>
            Dex: Lacey Rae grew up around loudmouths like Chet. She must have a comeback.
        <<endif>>
        <<if not flagged("f_cb_lou")>>
            Dex: Lou deals with rude customers all day. She'll have a line ready. A flat one.
        <<endif>>
        <<if not flagged("f_cb_ivy")>>
            Dex: Ivy notices everything. She's been watching Chet all night.
        <<endif>>
        <<if not flagged("f_cb_tess")>>
            Dex: Tess organised this whole audience. She knows something about Chet he doesn't.
        <<endif>>
        <<if not flagged("f_cb_jett")>>
            Dex: Jett finds everybody boring. She must have a way of saying so to a guy like Chet.
        <<endif>>
        <<if flagged("f_cb_lacey") and flagged("f_cb_lou") and flagged("f_cb_ivy") and flagged("f_cb_tess") and flagged("f_cb_jett")>>
            Dex: I've got five good comebacks. Each one fits exactly one insult. Listen to what Chet says, then answer that.
        <<endif>>
    <<elseif flagged("f_tape_swapped")>>
        <<if has("studio_walkie")>>
            Dex: Chet's feed is cut. Now I need Roxy watching him. I should show her that walkie from behind the camera.
        <<else>>
            Dex: Chet's feed is cut. Now I need Roxy watching him. There was something odd taped behind Camera One...
        <<endif>>
    <<elseif flagged("f_norma_on_chair")>>
        Dex: Norma's up on her chair with her eyes shut. I should grab Chet's tape out of the playback deck. Now!
    <<elseif has("nibbles_on_loan")>>
        Dex: Professor Nibbles is ready for his close-up. I should let him loose on Norma up in the booth.
    <<elseif flagged("f_norma_guards")>>
        Dex: Norma guards that playback deck like a dragon guards gold. I need her distracted.
        <<if flagged("f_asked_norma")>>
            Dex: Gloria said Norma's only scared of rodents. And I know a rodent. A very professional one, in Mina's pocket.
        <<else>>
            Dex: Gloria's worked with Norma for years. She'd know what rattles her.
        <<endif>>
    <<elseif flagged("f_booth_ok")>>
        Dex: I'm in the booth as Kevin. Somewhere up there is whatever's feeding Chet his lines. I should poke around the equipment.
    <<elseif has("runner_disguise")>>
        Dex: I've got the Kevin Kit. Up the booth stairs in the green room, press TALK and be Kevin.
    <<elseif flagged("f_booth_refused")>>
        Dex: Norma only lets crew into the booth: a headset and a lanyard. And she's expecting a runner called Kevin she's never met.
        <<if has("crew_headset") and has("runner_lanyard")>>
            Dex: I've got a headset and a lanyard. I should put them together.
        <<else>>
            <<if not has("runner_lanyard")>>
                Dex: A lanyard... Tess took charge of the studio's equipment log. Maybe Kevin's stuff is clipped to it.
            <<endif>>
            <<if has("dolly_headphones")>>
                Dex: Dolly's headphones need a little microphone arm sticking out. Something thin and bendy.
            <<elseif not has("crew_headset")>>
                Dex: A headset... Dolly wears headphones round her neck. Add a little microphone arm and that's a headset.
            <<endif>>
        <<endif>>
    <<elseif flagged("f_roxy_saw_walkie") or flagged("f_took_walkie")>>
        Dex: That walkie behind the camera is only a relay. The signal comes from upstairs, the control booth. The way up must be through the green room.
        <<if has("studio_walkie")>>
            Dex: And Roxy should see this walkie.
        <<endif>>
    <<else>>
        Roxy Vale: Chet still says you've got secret help.
        Dex: Funny, Chet keeps touching his ear and saying "copy that". Somebody is feeding HIM lines. From where, though?
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
<<if not flagged("f_miked")>>
    <<if has("lapel_mic") and has("nine_volt")>>
        Dex: I've got the mic pack and a battery. I should snap them together.
    <<elseif has("lapel_mic")>>
        <<if has("chet_protest_sign")>>
            Dex: Sky wanted a protest sign for her battery. I've got a beauty. I should give it to her.
        <<elseif flagged("f_sky_wants_sign")>>
            Dex: Sky will trade her battery for a protest sign. Something to write on, something red to write with.
            <<if has("reserved_card") and has("scandal_lipstick")>>
                Dex: Chet's card has a blank back, and I've got Scandal Red. Put them together.
            <<elseif not has("reserved_card") and not flagged("f_took_card")>>
                Dex: Something to write on... that RESERVED card in the green room has a blank back.
            <<elseif not has("scandal_lipstick")>>
                Dex: Something red... Gloria wears more lipstick than anyone I've ever met.
            <<endif>>
        <<elseif flagged("f_mina_tip")>>
            Dex: Mina said Sky has her spare nine-volt, in the megaphone. I should ask Sky.
        <<else>>
            Roxy Vale: That mic pack's as dead as my last relationship. It needs a battery.
            Dex: Mina's a scientist. Scientists always have batteries. Or know who does.
        <<endif>>
    <<elseif flagged("f_made_up")>>
        Dex: Gloria says I'm talent now. The mic packs are on her wardrobe rack.
    <<elseif flagged("f_took_card")>>
        Dex: The makeup chair's free. If I let Gloria powder me, she'll let me near the mic packs.
    <<elseif flagged("f_gr_intro")>>
        Dex: Gloria won't let me near the mic packs until I've been through her makeup chair. And Chet's "reserved" it with a little sign. Little signs go missing all the time.
    <<else>>
        Roxy Vale: No mic, no show. Wardrobe keeps the mic packs in the green room, through the door under the booth window.
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
<<if not flagged("f_shirt_clean")>>
    <<if flagged("f_shirt_wet")>>
        <<if flagged("f_asked_gloria_stain")>>
            Dex: The stain's gone, but I'm soaking wet. Gloria said her Turbo-Puff 3000 would dry it in no time.
        <<else>>
            Dex: The stain's gone, but I'm soaking wet. Somebody in the green room must own a hair dryer. Makeup people always do.
        <<endif>>
    <<elseif has("soda_water") and has("cocktail_napkin")>>
        Dex: Club soda and a napkin. Blot, don't rub. I just have to put them together.
    <<elseif flagged("f_bree_tip")>>
        Dex: Bree said club soda and a napkin. Blot, don't rub. Lou brought the drinks.
    <<else>>
        Roxy Vale: That purple stain is still screaming at my cameras.
        Dex: Who'd know how to fix a spill? Somebody who deals with spills all day. Like a waitress.
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
<<if not flagged("f_track_ready")>>
    <<if has("floor_fillers_tape")>>
        Dex: Dolly's mix is ready. It goes in the sound board.
    <<elseif has("chet_mixtape")>>
        <<if not flagged("f_tape_wound")>>
            <<if flagged("f_knows_rewind")>>
                Dex: Dolly said to wind the tape back in with a pencil. Bree always keeps one stuck in her bun.
            <<else>>
                Dex: I've got Chet's tape. A DJ could record over it. I know a DJ.
            <<endif>>
        <<elseif flagged("f_lent_cans") and not flagged("f_cans_back")>>
            <<if flagged("f_tape_swapped")>>
                Dex: Dolly needs her headphones back to mix, and they're part of my Kevin Kit. I'm done being Kevin. I should give it back to her.
            <<else>>
                Dex: Dolly can't mix without her headphones, and I still need them to be Kevin. Booth first, then I give them back.
            <<endif>>
        <<else>>
            Dex: The tape's wound up again. Dolly can record over it now.
        <<endif>>
    <<elseif flagged("f_saw_decks")>>
        Dex: Dolly's working on my track. I should check in with her.
    <<else>>
        Roxy Vale: And your dance-off track goes in the sound board. Go check it, sweetie.
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
===
title: F_Roxy_Walkie
---
<<if flagged("f_roxy_saw_walkie")>>
    Roxy Vale: I've seen it, lover boy. I need him to slip up, live.
<<else>>
    Roxy Vale: A walkie-talkie. Taped behind camera one. Labelled CHET. Set to channel CHET.
    Roxy Vale: (into it) Testing.
    Chet Studwell: (clutching his ear) OW! Who said that?
    Roxy Vale: Interesting. But my lawyers say "Chet" is a common name. I need him to slip up, live, where everybody can see it.
    Roxy Vale: Tell you what. Before every finale we shoot a Trash-Talk Teaser. Chet throws insults, you throw them back. He's never lost one. Not once. Suspicious, no?
    Roxy Vale: Cut off whoever's whispering in his ear, then beat him at it. If he's a fake, he'll crack.
    Dex: Cut off the whisperer. This walkie is only a relay: its little screen says RECEIVING FROM: BOOTH. So the voice comes from upstairs.
    Dex: And then I need comebacks. Good ones. Lots of people in that audience have dealt with a Chet.
    <<take studio_walkie>>
    <<flag f_roxy_saw_walkie>>
    <<flag f_duel_known>>
<<endif>>
===
title: F_Roxy_CheatTape
---
<<if flagged("f_roxy_saw_walkie")>>
    Roxy Vale: "CHET'S COMEBACKS. PLAY ON LOOP." Ha! Hang on to that, lover boy. He'll just say it's a podcast.
    Roxy Vale: Beat him at the Trash-Talk Teaser without it. When he cracks, THEN you show me.
<<else>>
    Roxy Vale: A tape with Chet's name on it? Lover boy, everything here has Chet's name on it. Show me how it reaches him.
<<endif>>
===
title: F_Roxy_Token
---
<<if flagged("finale_won")>>
    Roxy Vale: Your souvenirs are the reason you won, lover boy. Hang on to every one of them.
<<else>>
    Roxy Vale: Ooh, a keepsake! Save it for the show, lover boy. Every one of those is going to come up.
<<endif>>
===
title: F_Roxy_PostCredits
---
<<if not flagged("f_post1")>>
    Roxy Vale: Lover boy! The credits rolled, the lights are off, and you're still here. That's commitment.
    Roxy Vale: Network says the ratings were huge. Mostly from your dance moves. Mostly from people screaming.
    <<flag f_post1>>
<<elseif not flagged("f_post2")>>
    Roxy Vale: Next season I'm doing a spin-off. "Speed Daters Live: The Group Date." You're in every episode.
    Dex: All ten of them? At once?
    Roxy Vale: You'll need a bigger shirt.
    <<flag f_post2>>
<<elseif not flagged("f_post3")>>
    Roxy Vale: You know what I'll remember? Not the dance. You, running around all night bringing everybody exactly what they needed.
    Roxy Vale: ...Also the dance. Mostly the dance.
    <<flag f_post3>>
<<elseif not flagged("f_post4")>>
    Roxy Vale: Norma says there was a runner called Kevin on the crew tonight. Best runner she ever had. Then he vanished.
    Roxy Vale: (winks) Funny. He had your exact shirt.
    <<flag f_post4>>
<<else>>
    Roxy Vale: Go home, lover boy. Get some sleep. Your fan club's waiting outside, and they've made signs.
<<endif>>
===

title: F_Chet_Look
---
<<if flagged("finale_won")>>
    Dex: Chet Studwell, sitting on the floor, still slightly sticky with his own grape soda. His teeth have lost their sparkle.
<<elseif flagged("f_chet_busted")>>
    Dex: Chet, earpiece-free and sulking. Without someone feeding him lines, he keeps opening his mouth and nothing comes out.
<<elseif flagged("f_tape_swapped")>>
    Dex: Chet is slapping the side of his head like a ketchup bottle. Nothing's coming out of his earpiece. Nothing's coming out of him, either.
<<else>>
    Dex: Chet Studwell. Teeth like a toothpaste ad. He keeps touching his ear and muttering "copy that". To who?
    <<flag f_saw_earpiece>>
<<endif>>
===
title: F_Chet_Talk
---
<<if flagged("finale_won")>>
    Chet Studwell: This isn't over, Dooley. My dad's buying the network a second time. Just to cancel you.
    Dex: Chet, you can buy a network. You can't buy a hug. Want one?
    Chet Studwell: ...Maybe later. Don't tell anyone.
<<elseif flagged("f_chet_busted")>>
    Chet Studwell: Fine, you caught me. Big deal. I don't need help. I'm a natural.
    Chet Studwell: Ask me anything. Go on. Anything.
    Dex: What's my name?
    Chet Studwell: ...Rex? Dax? Dorkus?
<<elseif not flagged("f_talked_chet")>>
    Chet Studwell: Listen, kid. I've won every round of this show without breaking a sweat. Or learning a single name.
    Chet Studwell: (touches his ear) What? Yes. Copy that. (to Dex) Your shirt looks like a fruit salad that lost a fight.
    Dex: That was quick. Like somebody handed it to him.
    <<flag f_talked_chet>>
    <<flag f_saw_earpiece>>
    <<jump F_Chet_Menu>>
<<elseif flagged("f_tape_swapped")>>
    Chet Studwell: (tapping his ear) Hello? Copy that? ...Copy ANYTHING? (to Dex) What do YOU want, Dorkus?
    <<jump F_Chet_Menu>>
<<else>>
    Chet Studwell: (touches his ear) Copy that. (to Dex) Run along, loser. Grown-ups are winning.
    <<jump F_Chet_Menu>>
<<endif>>
===
title: F_Chet_Menu
---
-> Who do you keep talking to? <<if not flagged("f_chet_ask_ear")>>
    Chet Studwell: Nobody! My... ear. I talk to my ear. Champions do that. It's called "self-talk". Look it up.
    Dex: Somebody's feeding him lines through that earpiece. There must be a radio around here somewhere.
    <<flag f_chet_ask_ear>>
    <<jump F_Chet_Menu>>
-> Trash talk. You and me. Right now. <<if flagged("f_duel_known")>>
    <<jump F_Duel_Start>>
-> What does your dad do? <<if not flagged("f_chet_dad")>>
    Chet Studwell: He owns the network. And this building. And a smaller backup network, in case this one's mean to me.
    <<flag f_chet_dad>>
    <<jump F_Chet_Menu>>
-> Nice teeth. <<if not flagged("f_chet_teeth")>>
    Chet Studwell: I know. They're so white they've got their own lighting crew.
    Dex: That sounded rehearsed. I bet he says it a lot.
    <<flag f_chet_teeth>>
    <<jump F_Chet_Menu>>
-> Did you really spill that soda on purpose? <<if not flagged("f_chet_soda")>>
    Chet Studwell: Spill? I don't spill. I make contributions. You're welcome.
    <<flag f_chet_soda>>
    <<jump F_Chet_Menu>>
-> Later, Chet.
    Chet Studwell: Later, loser. Copy that. I mean... later.
===
title: F_Chet_Walkie
---
Chet Studwell: Never seen that walkie-talkie in my life. And I definitely didn't write CHET on it in glitter pen.
Dex: He wrote CHET on it in glitter pen.
===
title: F_Chet_CheatTape
---
Chet Studwell: Never seen it. Give it here. I mean, never seen it. Give it here anyway.
Dex: Nice try, Chet.
===
title: F_Chet_Card
---
Chet Studwell: My reserved card! ...Keep it. I've got forty. I reserve things recreationally.
===
title: F_Chet_Sign
---
Chet Studwell: CHET IS A... hey! That's slander! Slander with excellent penmanship, but slander!
===
title: F_Chet_Item
---
Chet Studwell: I don't take handouts, loser. Unless they're trophies.
===

title: F_Duel_Start
---
<<if flagged("f_chet_busted")>>
    Dex: I already won that one.
<<elseif not flagged("f_roxy_saw_walkie")>>
    Dex: Trash-talk Chet with Roxy not paying attention? He'd just deny everything. I need her watching him first.
<<elseif not flagged("f_tape_swapped")>>
    <<jump F_Duel_Rigged>>
<<else>>
    Roxy Vale: Ooh! Are we doing the Trash-Talk Teaser? Camera two, get in close!
    Roxy Vale: Gentlemen: five insults. Chet throws, Dex catches. One fumble and it's over.
    Chet Studwell: (tapping his ear) Fine. I don't need help. I'm a natural. ...Hello? Is this thing on?
    <<jump F_Duel_1>>
<<endif>>
===
title: F_Duel_Rigged
---
Roxy Vale: Trash-Talk Teaser! Places, boys!
Chet Studwell: You dance like a folding chair falling down the stairs.
-> "A folding chair still holds folks up. When's the last time you did that?" <<if flagged("f_cb_lacey")>>
    <<jump F_Duel_Topped>>
-> "Oh yeah? Well... your face!"
    <<jump F_Duel_Topped>>
-> "I know you are, but what am I?"
    <<jump F_Duel_Topped>>
===
title: F_Duel_Topped
---
Chet Studwell: (touches his ear, listens, nods) Copy that.
Chet Studwell: Ahem. Nice try, Dooley. But I've got a comeback for your comeback, and a comeback for THAT comeback. Point, Studwell.
Roxy Vale: Ooh, he's quick tonight. Suspiciously quick.
Dex: Every time I say something, the voice in his ear hands him an answer. While that feed is running, I can't win.
===

title: F_Duel_1
---
Chet Studwell: Round one. You dance like a folding chair falling down the stairs.
-> "A folding chair still holds folks up. When's the last time you did that?" <<if flagged("f_cb_lacey")>>
    Lacey Rae: (from the audience) YEEHAW! That's my freshman!
    Chet Studwell: I... hold things. I hold trophies.
    <<jump F_Duel_2>>
-> "Nice teeth. Shame nothing smart ever comes out between them." <<if flagged("f_cb_lou")>>
    <<jump F_Duel_Lose>>
-> "Must be quiet in there. The trophies are the only ones who'll listen to you." <<if flagged("f_cb_ivy")>>
    <<jump F_Duel_Lose>>
-> "Funny. Tess made the seating chart, and you're listed under Fire Exit." <<if flagged("f_cb_tess")>>
    <<jump F_Duel_Lose>>
-> "Sorry, what was your name again? Chad? Chip? Chuck?" <<if flagged("f_cb_jett")>>
    <<jump F_Duel_Lose>>
-> "Your roots are showing." <<if flagged("f_cb_gloria")>>
    <<jump F_Duel_Roots>>
-> "Oh yeah? Well... your face!"
    <<jump F_Duel_Lose>>
-> "I know you are, but what am I?"
    <<jump F_Duel_Lose>>
===
title: F_Duel_2
---
Chet Studwell: My teeth are so white they've got their own lighting crew.
-> "A folding chair still holds folks up. When's the last time you did that?" <<if flagged("f_cb_lacey")>>
    <<jump F_Duel_Lose>>
-> "Nice teeth. Shame nothing smart ever comes out between them." <<if flagged("f_cb_lou")>>
    Lou: (from the audience) Heh.
